msgstr "磁力计"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2211
msgid "Microphone"
msgstr "麦克风"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2212
msgid "MIDI"
msgstr "MIDI"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2213
msgid "Payment"
msgstr "支付"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2214
msgid "USB"
msgstr "USB"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2224
msgid "Deny"
msgstr "拒绝"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2225
msgid "Self only"
msgstr "仅自身"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2226
msgid "Allow all"
msgstr "全部允许"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2237
msgid "Send Content-Security-Policy header"
msgstr "发送 Content-Security-Policy 头"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2239
msgid ""
"CSP restricts where scripts, styles, and other resources may load from, "
"mitigating XSS and injection. CSP is site-specific and can break themes or "
"page builders — start in report-only mode to surface violations before "
"enforcing."
msgstr ""
"CSP 限制脚本、样式和其他资源可加载的来源，从而缓解 XSS 和注入攻击。CSP 与站点高度相关，可能会破坏主题或页面构建器 —— "
"请先在仅报告模式下运行以发现违规情况，再正式强制执行。"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2245
msgid "Report-only (recommended for first deploy)"
msgstr "仅报告（首次部署推荐）"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2246
msgid "Enforce"
msgstr "强制执行"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2248
msgid ""
"Report-only sends Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only — the browser logs "
"violations but still loads blocked resources. Enforce sends Content-"
"Security-Policy and blocks them."
msgstr ""
"仅报告会发送 Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only —— 浏览器记录违规但仍加载被阻止的资源。强制执行会发送 "
"Content-Security-Policy 并阻止它们。"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2251
msgid "Policy directives"
msgstr "策略指令"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2254
msgid ""
"Single line of directives separated by semicolons. The default starter "
"policy permits Gutenberg and most themes; tighten once your reports are "
"clean."
msgstr "以分号分隔的单行指令。默认的起始策略允许 Gutenberg 和大多数主题；待报告无违规后再收紧。"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2255
msgid "CSP reference (MDN)"
msgstr "CSP 参考（MDN）"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2259
msgid "Report URI (optional)"
msgstr "Report URI（可选）"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2261
msgid ""
"When set, browsers will POST violation reports to this URL. Appended "
"automatically as report-uri unless your directives already contain one."
msgstr "设置后，浏览器会将违规报告 POST 到此 URL。除非您的指令中已包含 report-uri，否则会自动追加。"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2265
msgid "Cookie Hardening"
msgstr "Cookie 加固"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2269
msgid "Add SameSite attribute to auth cookies"
msgstr "为认证 Cookies 添加 SameSite 属性"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2271
msgid ""
"Adds SameSite flag to WordPress session cookies. Protects against CSRF "
"attacks. Mozilla Observatory penalizes missing SameSite."
msgstr ""
"为 WordPress 会话 Cookies 添加 SameSite 标志。可防御 CSRF 攻击。Mozilla Observatory 会对缺失 "
"SameSite 的站点扣分。"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2275
msgid "SameSite value"
msgstr "SameSite 值"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2277
msgid "Lax (recommended)"
msgstr "Lax（推荐）"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2280
msgid ""
"Strict may break OAuth/SSO login flows that redirect back to your site."
msgstr "Strict 可能会破坏会重定向回您站点的 OAuth/SSO 登录流程。"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2291
msgid "Headers Preview"
msgstr "头部预览"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2303
msgid "Enable Information Shield"
msgstr "启用信息防护"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2305
msgid ""
"Reduces WordPress information disclosure by removing version fingerprints, "
"discovery endpoints, and unnecessary metadata from HTTP headers and HTML "
"output."
msgstr "通过从 HTTP 头部和 HTML 输出中移除版本指纹、发现端点和不必要的元数据，减少 WordPress 的信息泄露。"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2308
msgid "Enable All Recommended"
msgstr "启用所有推荐项"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2312
msgid "HTTP Header Disclosure"
msgstr "HTTP 头部泄露"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2316
msgid "Remove X-Powered-By header"
msgstr "移除 X-Powered-By 头"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2318
msgid "Removes the header that reveals your PHP version."
msgstr "移除暴露您 PHP 版本的头部。"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2324
msgid "Remove Server header"
msgstr "移除 Server 头"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2326
msgid ""
"Removes the header that identifies your web server software. Best-effort."
msgstr "移除标识您 Web 服务器软件的头部。尽力而为。"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2332
msgid "Remove X-Pingback header"
msgstr "移除 X-Pingback 头"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2334
msgid "Hides the pingback/XML-RPC endpoint URL from response headers."
msgstr "在响应头中隐藏 pingback/XML-RPC 端点 URL。"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2339
msgid "Remove REST API Link: header"
msgstr "移除 REST API Link 头"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2341
msgid "Removes the HTTP Link header that advertises the REST API endpoint."
msgstr "移除宣告 REST API 端点的 HTTP Link 头。"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2346
msgid "Remove Shortlink Link: header"
msgstr "移除 Shortlink Link 头"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2348
msgid "Removes the rel=shortlink HTTP header."
msgstr "移除 rel=shortlink HTTP 头。"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2351
msgid "HTML Meta and Links"
msgstr "HTML Meta 与链接"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2355
msgid "Remove WordPress generator tag"
msgstr "移除 WordPress 生成器标签"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2357
msgid ""
"Removes the meta generator tag and RSS generator that reveal your WordPress "
"version."
msgstr "移除暴露您 WordPress 版本的 meta 生成器标签和 RSS 生成器。"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2362
msgid "Remove RSD link"
msgstr "移除 RSD 链接"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2364
msgid "Removes the Really Simple Discovery endpoint link from HTML head."
msgstr "从 HTML head 中移除 Really Simple Discovery 端点链接。"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2369
msgid "Remove WLW manifest link"
msgstr "移除 WLW 信息清单链接"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2371
msgid ""
"Removes the Windows Live Writer manifest link. Only needed if you use WLW to"
" write posts."
msgstr "移除 Windows Live Writer 信息清单链接。仅当您使用 WLW 撰写文章时才需要。"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2376
msgid "Remove REST API discovery link"
msgstr "移除 REST API 发现链接"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2378
msgid ""
"Removes the discovery link tag from HTML head. The REST API itself remains "
"functional at /wp-json/."
msgstr "从 HTML head 中移除发现链接标签。REST API 本身在 /wp-json/ 仍然可用。"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2383
msgid "Remove oEmbed discovery links"
msgstr "移除 oEmbed 发现链接"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2385
msgid ""
"Prevents other sites from showing rich embed previews when linking to your "
"content."
msgstr "防止其他站点在链接到您的内容时显示富嵌入预览。"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2390
msgid "Remove shortlink meta tag"
msgstr "移除 shortlink meta 标签"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2392
msgid "Removes the shortlink link tag from HTML head."
msgstr "从 HTML head 中移除 shortlink 链接标签。"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2397
msgid "Remove emoji scripts and styles"
msgstr "移除 Emoji 脚本和样式"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2399
msgid ""
"Removes the WordPress emoji polyfill JavaScript and CSS. Modern browsers "
"have native emoji support."
msgstr "移除 WordPress Emoji polyfill 的 JavaScript 和 CSS。现代浏览器原生支持 Emoji。"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2404
msgid "Remove RSS/Atom feed links"
msgstr "移除 RSS/Atom Feed 链接"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2406
msgid ""
"May break RSS readers and WordPress.com Reader. Only enable if your site "
"does not use RSS feeds."
msgstr "可能会破坏 RSS 阅读器和 WordPress.com Reader。仅当您的站点不使用 RSS 订阅源时才启用。"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2411
msgid "Remove adjacent post links"
msgstr "移除相邻文章链接"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2413
msgid "Removes prev/next post rel links from HTML head."
msgstr "从 HTML head 中移除上/下一篇文章的 rel 链接。"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2416
msgid "Asset Fingerprinting"
msgstr "资源指纹"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2420
msgid "Remove version query strings"
msgstr "移除版本查询字符串"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2422
msgid ""
"Strips ?ver= from CSS and JavaScript URLs. Browser-cached assets may become "
"stale after plugin or theme updates."
msgstr "从 CSS 和 JavaScript URL 中去除 ?ver=。插件或主题更新后，浏览器缓存的资源可能会过期。"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2429
msgid "Disable XML-RPC entirely"
msgstr "完全停用 XML-RPC"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2431
msgid ""
"Some plugins (Jetpack, WordPress mobile app) require XML-RPC. Disable only "
"if you do not use them."
msgstr "部分插件（Jetpack、WordPress 移动应用）需要 XML-RPC。仅在您不使用它们时停用。"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2443
msgid "Security Self-Check"
msgstr "安全自检"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2445
msgid ""
"Segurium runs the same checks as leading external security scanners, plus "
"WordPress-specific hardening checks, and grades your site A+ to F. Results "
"are saved until the next run."
msgstr ""
"Segurium 运行与主流外部安全扫描器相同的检查，再加上针对 WordPress 的加固检查，并将您的站点评级为 A+ 到 "
"F。结果会保留到下一次运行。"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2464
msgid "Check results"
msgstr "检查结果"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2466
msgid "Independent verification"
msgstr "独立验证"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2468
msgid "Cross-check results with these public scanners:"
msgstr "使用以下公共扫描器交叉验证结果："

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2471
msgid "securityheaders.com"
msgstr "securityheaders.com"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2472
msgid "Mozilla Observatory"
msgstr "Mozilla Observatory"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2485
msgid "Included"
msgstr "包含"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2488
msgid "Hardening — included in every install"
msgstr "加固 —— 每次安装均包含"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2491
msgid ""
"Two-factor authentication (TOTP, email fallback, backup codes, trusted "
"devices)"
msgstr "双重身份验证（TOTP、邮件回退、备份代码、可信设备）"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2496
msgid ""
"Brute-force protection (rate limits, lockouts, honeypot, optional hCaptcha)"
msgstr "暴力破解防护（速率限制、锁定、蜜罐、可选 hCaptcha）"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2501
msgid "Geo-blocking (login + admin gating with confirm-or-revert safety net)"
msgstr "地理位置封锁（登录 + 管理后台限制，带「确认或还原」安全网）"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2506
msgid "Firewall (allow / deny IP rules, CIDR, country filter)"
msgstr "防火墙（允许/拒绝 IP 规则、CIDR、国家/地区筛选）"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2511
msgid "Security headers and cookie hardening (presets, custom)"
msgstr "安全头和 Cookie 加固（预设、自定义）"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2516
msgid "Information Shield (version and endpoint hiding)"
msgstr "信息防护（隐藏版本与端点）"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2521
msgid "Self-Check security grade (A+ to F, one-click Fix)"
msgstr "自检安全评级（A+ 到 F，一键修复）"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2526
msgid "Activity log (append-only, per-event-type retention)"
msgstr "活动日志（仅追加，按事件类型分别保留）"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2531
msgid "Migration importer (Wordfence, AIOS, Sucuri, Solid Security)"
msgstr "迁移导入器（Wordfence、AIOS、Sucuri、Solid Security）"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2536
msgid "Disaster recovery (encrypted reversible backups, extractable offline)"
msgstr "灾难恢复（加密可逆备份，可离线提取）"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2543
msgid "Detection and remediation"
msgstr "检测与修复"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2546
msgid "Real-time detection (malware + integrity)"
msgstr "实时检测（恶意软件 + 完整性）"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2547 includes/class-segurium.php:2548
msgid "Full"
msgstr "完整"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2551
msgid "Malware cleanup"
msgstr "恶意软件清理"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2552
msgid "3 files / 30 days"
msgstr "3 个文件 / 30 天"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2553 includes/class-segurium.php:2559
#: includes/class-segurium.php:2564
msgid "Unlimited"
msgstr "无限"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2557
msgid "Integrity fix: clean files (modified, missing, or extra)"
msgstr "完整性修复：清理文件（被修改、缺失或多余）"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2558
msgid "Unlimited — does not count against the cleanup quota"
msgstr "无限 —— 不计入清理配额"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2562
msgid "Integrity fix: infected files"
msgstr "完整性修复：受感染文件"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2563
msgid "Counts against the 3 / 30 days cleanup quota"
msgstr "计入 3 / 30 天清理配额"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2567
msgid "Bulk “Fix All” (malware + integrity)"
msgstr "批量「全部修复」（恶意软件 + 完整性）"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2572
msgid "Auto-fix (unattended remediation)"
msgstr "自动修复（无人值守修复）"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2577
msgid "Email alerts on findings (max 1 / site / 24h)"
msgstr "发现时发送电子邮件提醒（每站点每 24 小时最多 1 封）"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2583
msgid "Community"
msgstr "社区"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2584
msgid "Email (best-effort queue)"
msgstr "电子邮件（尽力而为队列）"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2597
msgid "Service tiers"
msgstr "服务级别"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2599
msgid ""
"Every plugin feature ships on every install. The service tier governs the "
"cloud cleanup quota Segurium will perform on your behalf — your current tier"
" is highlighted."
msgstr "每项插件功能都会包含在每次安装中。服务级别决定了 Segurium 将代您执行的云清理配额——您当前的级别已突出显示。"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2604
msgid "Capability"
msgstr "权限"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2606 includes/class-segurium.php:2801
msgid "Free"
msgstr "免费版"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2608 includes/class-segurium.php:2614
msgid "Current plan"
msgstr "当前套餐"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2651
msgid "Scan Settings"
msgstr "扫描设置"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2654
msgid ""
"Exclude files from scan that match these wildcard patterns (one per line)"
msgstr "从扫描中排除与下列通配符模式匹配的文件（每行一项）"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2656
msgid ""
"Use * as a wildcard. For example, *.log will exclude all log files. vendor/*"
" will exclude the vendor directory and everything inside it."
msgstr "使用 * 作为通配符。例如，*.log 将排除所有日志文件；vendor/* 将排除 vendor 目录及其内部的全部内容。"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2669
msgid "Wipe encrypted backups when the plugin is uninstalled"
msgstr "卸载插件时抹除加密备份"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2671
msgid ""
"Off (default): encrypted backups of deleted components and cured files are "
"kept in wp-content/segurium-data after uninstall, so a reinstall can still "
"restore them. Turn on only if you want a hard deletion on uninstall."
msgstr ""
"关闭（默认）：卸载后，已删除组件和已修复文件的加密备份保留在 wp-content/segurium-data "
"中，重新安装后仍可还原。仅当您希望在卸载时进行硬删除时才开启。"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2677
msgid "Email me about findings"
msgstr "通过电子邮件通知我发现的问题"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2679
msgid ""
"Send a daily digest of malware verdicts and successful cleanups, delivered "
"from support@segurium.com. At most one email per site per 24 hours."
msgstr "发送每日摘要，包含恶意软件判定和成功的清理，由 support@segurium.com 发送。每个站点每 24 小时最多一封。"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2680
msgid "Alert email address"
msgstr "提醒邮箱地址"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2688
msgid "Leave blank to use the WordPress site admin email."
msgstr "留空将使用 WordPress 站点管理员邮箱。"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2698
msgid "Automatically clean detected malware"
msgstr "自动清理检测到的恶意软件"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2700
msgid ""
"After every scheduled or real-time scan, files with a known malware or "
"injection verdict are cleaned without requiring a click. Files you have "
"ignored (by path or by hash) are skipped."
msgstr "每次计划扫描或实时扫描后，被判定为已知恶意软件或注入的文件将被自动清理，无需点击。您已忽略的文件（按路径或按哈希）会被跳过。"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2710
msgid "Scheduled Scan"
msgstr "计划扫描"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2712
msgid ""
"Run a full malware scan automatically on a recurring schedule. A scheduled "
"scan does the same work as a manual scan, but does not require you to keep "
"your browser open. A scheduled tick that fires while a manual scan is "
"already in progress is skipped, not queued."
msgstr ""
"按周期定时自动运行完整恶意软件扫描。定时扫描与手动扫描完成相同的工作，但无需您保持浏览器打开。如果定时触发时已有手动扫描在进行中，则会跳过此次触发，不会排队。"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2739
msgid "Save Schedule"
msgstr "保存定时设置"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2747
msgid ""
"Import settings from other security plugins into Segurium. Existing Segurium"
" settings are preserved; imported data is merged."
msgstr "将其他安全插件的设置导入到 Segurium。现有 Segurium 设置会被保留；导入的数据会被合并。"

